d":"Ax+e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ade26571-533d-403d-b474-4541dc9ae824","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"どうもそのようでした。構造体のメンバを関数の interface{} な引数としてわたしてしまうとアウト","ts":"1635610565.228000","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1635610578.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WCCLw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1fe76f4-e63d-4560-9a3c-e9129caf9f4f","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ああこれはエスケープ解析の問題か…なるほど","ts":"1635610005.227300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g9vrx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b5ae926-7916-491b-b847-b37b0371f5ba","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"構造体コピーが heap allocation になることがあるっぽいんですが、それの条件ってなんでしょうね","ts":"1635609820.226900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CGHa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1FF81518-C5D1-41DA-828C-08352DF0C1B8","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"厳密なこと言っちゃいますと\natan2は全単射ではないので逆関数は存在しませんね、\nそもそも tan の逆関数が atan で　それを拡張した物が　atan2 のはずですから","ts":"1635646917.236500","thread_ts":"1635646574.233000","parent_user_id":"US5UW1UNB","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4LSdF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e890cc5e-803f-4743-8d01-b114e024b9b7","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"atan2 の定義域を sincos の地域に限定すれば互いに逆関数になる、ぐらいの気持ちだった","ts":"1635647131.236700","thread_ts":"1635646574.233000","parent_user_id":"US5UW1UNB","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K9U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13AE65CA-0942-4539-93EC-EF82B01E3527","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"なんとなく言いたいことはわかります。\n数学屋のダメな癖ですね……厳密な議論をしてしまうのは…","ts":"1635647245.238000","thread_ts":"1635646574.233000","parent_user_id":"US5UW1UNB","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pGGQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7dc84da-ae4e-40c6-b296-6304288a6c1b","type":"message","user":"US5UW1UNB","text":"いえいえ\n\natan2|Im(sincos)\n\nrestriction 使ってなんかこんな感じでかけましたよね確か","ts":"1635647417.239100","thread_ts":"1635646574.233000","parent_user_id":"US5UW1UNB","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kYr8U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb20f247-b2c3-4f3b-9703-574a6ee40b3f","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"ああそうか、 atan2 の引数は二つなんですね\n\natan2 は\nR^2 -\u0026gt; X { -pi \u0026lt; x \u0026lt;= pi | x in R}\nへの写像\n\nsincos は\nX { -pi \u0026lt; x \u0026lt;= pi| x in R} -\u0026gt; Y {x, y | x^2 + y^2 = 0, (x, y) in R^2}\nへの写像が厳密な話ですね","ts":"1635647820.239400","thread_ts":"1635646574.233000","edited":{"user":"U02GD5GRJ72","ts":"1635648042.000000"},"parent_user_id":"US5UW1UNB","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lpx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8cc36ae-abdd-4427-bc03-94251113c7be","type":"message","user":"U02GD5GRJ72","text":"sincos(atan2( x, y )) でベクトル (x, y) を正規化できますね！","ts":"1635648162.239700","thread_ts":"1635646574.233000","parent_user_id":"US5UW1UNB","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B9v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"024923c7-c31f-4723-a973-d53e8188d9c1","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Before the fix:\n```internal/graphicsdriver/opengl/context_js.go:462:74: moved to heap: typ```\n After the fix:\n```internal/graphicsdriver/opengl/context_js.go:521:3: moved to heap: t```\n","ts":"1635667113.242300","thread_ts":"1635613872.228800","parent_user_id":"UERCTTT8B","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I0gw"}]}]
